  "description": "This 4-ply, 16x6.50-8-inch lawn mower tire kit includes two pre-mounted pneumatic tires with tubes, offering a 620-lb load capacity, 28 PSI max inflation, a turf-friendly tread for better traction and minimal lawn damage, and comes ready to install on compatible mowers—but is not for highway use.\nFeatures\nCOMPATIBILITY & SPECIFICATIONS: This lawn mower tires kit fits most mowers with size 16x6.50-8\". Tire Load Range: B/4PR/4PLY, Rim Width: 8\", Section Width: 6.5\", Outer Diameter: 16\", Tread Depth: 0.2\", Offset Hub: 3\", Bushings: 3/4\", Max Load: 620 lbs, Max Inflation: 28 PSI. (Not for highway use.)\nTURF-FRIENDLY & HIGH-PERFORMANCE TREAD: The unique tread pattern boosts traction while minimizing lawn damage. The wide, flat footprint spreads pressure evenly, reduces noise, improves heat dissipation and water drainage, and gives you better handling, smoother ride, and quieter operation.\nUPGRADED 4-PLY TIRE: Made from quality natural rubber, these 4‑ply pneumatic 16x6.50-8 lawnmower tires deliver high load capacity and durability. You get dependable traction and smooth rolling, whether you're mowing a small yard or handling large acreage – stable, reliable performance every time.\nCOMPLETE TIRE KIT – READY TO INSTALL: No need to hunt down separate tires, wheels, or tubes. These lawn tractor tires come pre‑mounted on rims with bushings already installed. Just remove your old tires and bolt these on. Saves you time and hassle – no extra parts or assembly required.\nPLEASE NOTE: This kit includes 2PCS 16x6.5-8 tires with tubes for riding lawn mowers. Not for highway use. Double‑check your mower's tire size and rim dimensions against our specs before buying to ensure a proper fit.",
